DESCRIPTION:Oh man! We're excited to announce that Hot Dad Calendar is hitt
 ing their 10 year anniversary\, and they're taking over City Hall! Born in
  Reading\, PA\, and raised throughout the Central PA/Greater Philadelphia 
 Area\, Hot Dad Calendar is the authentic result of three friends combining
  their distinctive styles and personalities to bring a fresh\, nostalgic s
 ound to the alternative/indie rock scene. With heavy tones and even heavie
 r subject matter\, this gritty trio embodies the belief that being a Hot D
 ad is not just about aesthetics or fatherhood\; It's about earnestly confr
 onting what makes you who you are... while also being really Hot \;) Joini
 ng them are Sun Not Yellow and Sweaty Money\, two of the finest rock and r
 ollers around! It's gonna get sweaty\, it's gonna be loud\, and it's gonna
  be HOT! Grab your friends\, get your tickets\, and join us!\n\nPrice: Not
